# GUB.102: Circuits & signals

A space to explore electronics, one connection at a time.

This is a sample course for future work. Dates, policies, and assignments are placeholders.

Guests can read lessons. An enrolled account is required to submit practice to this server.

## Module 01: Meet the circuit

Nodes, loops, and a first simple model.

